<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ht">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Distribisyon Kle Seremoni — <%= @election.title %></title>
  <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
  <%= stylesheet_link_tag "application", "data-turbo-track": "reload" %>
  <style>
    @page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 12mm; }
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; color: #111; }
    .envelope-card {
      page-break-inside: avoid;
      page-break-after: always;
      border: 2px dashed #333;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 18mm 14mm;
      margin-bottom: 8mm;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .envelope-card:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
    .envelope-header { border-bottom: 1px solid #888; padding-bottom: 6mm; margin-bottom: 6mm; }
    .key-block {
      font-family: "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 10pt;
      line-height: 1.5;
      word-break: break-all;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      border-left: 4px solid #c0392b;
      padding: 8mm;
      margin: 4mm 0;
    }
    .qr-box {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 4mm;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .warning {
      color: #c0392b;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 10pt;
    }
    .meta { font-size: 9pt; color: #555; }
    .no-print { background: #fffbe6; border: 1px solid #f0c36d; padding: 12px; margin: 16px 0; }
    @media print { .no-print { display: none !important; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="no-print">
  <h3>⚠️ PAJ SA YO PARÈT YON SÈL FWA</h3>
  <p>
    Lè w fèmen onglè sa a oubyen rafrechi paj la, kle prive yo p ap janm
    rekipere ankò. <strong>Enprime kounye a</strong> (Cmd/Ctrl+P), siyen
    chak anvlòp, e remèt yo manm konsèy yo an pèsòn.
  </p>
  <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="window.print()">🖨️ Enprime kounye a</button>
  <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary ms-2"
     href="<%= partner_portal_election_ceremony_path(@election) %>"
     onclick="return confirm('Sèten? Kle prive yo ap pèdi nèt.');">
    Kite paj la
  </a>
</div>

<div class="envelope-card">
  <div class="envelope-header">
    <h2 style="margin:0;">Seremoni Dechifraj CEP</h2>
    <p class="meta" style="margin:2mm 0 0;">
      Eleksyon: <strong><%= @election.title %></strong> &middot;
      ID: <code><%= @election.id %></code> &middot;
      Jenere: <%= l(Time.current, format: :long) %>
    </p>
    <p class="meta" style="margin:2mm 0 0;">
      Anprent kle mèt la (SHA-256, 16 premye karaktè):
      <code><%= @election.decryption_key_fingerprint.to_s[0, 16] %>…</code>
    </p>
  </div>

  <h3>Sa ki nan distribisyon sa a</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>9 anvlòp</strong> — youn pou chak manm konsèy CEP</li>
    <li>Chak anvlòp gen yon <strong>kle prive X25519</strong> ak yon <strong>QR backup</strong></li>
    <li>Sistèm la bezwen <strong>5 sou 9</strong> manm prezan ak kle yo pou rekonstwi rezilta yo</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="warning">
    Pa janm pataje yon kle prive sou imèl, SMS, oswa foto. Yo dwe rete sou papye
    nan yon kès an asye sou wòl chak manm konsèy la.
  </p>
</div>

<% @printable.each_with_index do |envelope, idx| %>
  <div class="envelope-card">
    <div class="envelope-header">
      <h2 style="margin:0;">
        Anvlòp #<%= idx + 1 %> — <%= envelope[:role_label] %>
      </h2>
      <p class="meta" style="margin:2mm 0 0;">
        Wòl teknik: <code><%= envelope[:role] %></code> &middot;
        Shard ID: <code>#<%= envelope[:shard_id] %></code>
      </p>
    </div>

    <h4>1️⃣ Kle prive X25519 (DAR PA EXPOZE)</h4>
    <div class="key-block">
      <%= envelope[:recipient_private_key_b64] %>
    </div>
    <p class="meta">
      Sa a se kle a tape sou jou seremoni an pou dechifre shard ou.
      Si w pèdi li, ou ka itilize QR backup la pi ba a.
    </p>

    <h4 style="margin-top:8mm;">2️⃣ QR Backup (siyen pa platfòm la)</h4>
    <div class="qr-box">
      <%
        qr_json = envelope[:qr_payload].to_json
        qr      = RQRCode::QRCode.new(qr_json, level: :m)
        svg     = qr.as_svg(module_size: 4, standalone: true,
                            use_path: true, viewbox: true)
      %>
      <%= svg.html_safe %>
      <p class="meta" style="margin-top:3mm;">
        Siyen Ed25519 — issuer <code>bonvote.ht</code> — typ <code>ShardBackup</code>
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="meta">
      QR sa a gen valè cleartext shard la, siyen pa platfòm la.
      Sou jou seremoni an, scanne li si w pa ka tape kle prive a.
      <strong>Pa janm voye QR sa a sou imèl oswa entènèt.</strong>
    </p>

    <p class="warning" style="margin-top:6mm;">
      ✂️ Koupe paj sa a, pliye li nan dyaspora ak <strong>siyen non w</strong>
      anba a, lèfini mete li nan kès sekirite ou.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top:10mm; border-top:1px solid #888; padding-top:6mm;">
      Resevwa pa: ____________________________________
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
      Dat: ______________
    </p>
  </div>
<% end %>

</body>
</html>
